WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.374 --> 00:00:04.421
- Fricken mosquitoes, so itchy.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:05.921
- I'm on it, okay.

00:00:07.985 --> 00:00:11.015
We got, this for the itching,
this for the swelling,

00:00:11.015 --> 00:00:13.557
and Xanax just for fun.

00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:16.057
(peppy music)

00:00:18.254 --> 00:00:19.543
- Well that's the thing, our anniversary

00:00:19.543 --> 00:00:21.673
is next week and I still
don't know what to get her.

00:00:21.673 --> 00:00:23.274
- I emailed you my Nordstrom's wishlist,

00:00:23.274 --> 00:00:24.407
there are five things on there,

00:00:24.407 --> 00:00:27.240
but you only need to get me three.

00:00:29.188 --> 00:00:30.212
- I'm kind of hungry.

00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:31.424
- Oh, I brought some things.

00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:33.828
- No way! - Yeah.

00:00:33.828 --> 00:00:37.527
Uh, just a little bit,
corn chips, cookies,

00:00:37.527 --> 00:00:38.995
a whole rotisserie chicken.

00:00:38.995 --> 00:00:41.745
- (droning) Wow.

00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:44.363
- What's wrong, is it not good?

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:45.919
- It's not what I ordered, but it's fine.

00:00:45.919 --> 00:00:47.162
I got a burger but it's okay.

00:00:47.162 --> 00:00:47.995
- Send it back!

00:00:47.995 --> 00:00:49.020
- I'm not even that hungry so...

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.361
- Are you joking?

00:00:50.361 --> 00:00:51.194
- No...

00:00:51.194 --> 00:00:52.027
- Excuse me!

00:00:52.027 --> 00:00:52.860
- [Waiter] Hi.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.367
- Hi, this is actually
not what he ordered.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.839
- [Waiter] Oh yeah, let
me exchange that for you.

00:00:55.839 --> 00:00:56.875
- Thank you so much, and would you mind,

00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:57.947
just cause I'm already almost done,

00:00:57.947 --> 00:00:59.394
maybe we can take that off the bill

00:00:59.394 --> 00:01:01.838
and also maybe get like a beer
on the house or something?

00:01:01.838 --> 00:01:03.004
- [Waiter] Yeah, of course. A Stella?

00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:04.065
- Yeah, sure.

00:01:04.065 --> 00:01:04.898
- [Waiter] Great.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.691
- Thank you.

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:07.885
- How did you do that?

00:01:07.885 --> 00:01:09.019
That was incredible.

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:10.486
- You're allowed to send stuff back.

00:01:10.486 --> 00:01:12.351
This one is roasted turkey,
but there's another one

00:01:12.351 --> 00:01:16.749
so you can decide, this one is
black bean and sweet potato.

00:01:16.749 --> 00:01:20.269
Turns out, he's the one
that's allergic to dairy!

00:01:20.269 --> 00:01:22.561
(all laughing)

00:01:22.561 --> 00:01:25.254
I know, I know, I know!

00:01:25.254 --> 00:01:26.921
Kyle, you didn't tell
me your boss was Jewish,

00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:29.705
we go to the same synagogue
and his mom's cousin

00:01:29.705 --> 00:01:31.963
is my best friend's sister's gynecologist.

00:01:31.963 --> 00:01:34.891
- Her cousin Glen did my
nephew's fiance's colonoscopy.

00:01:34.891 --> 00:01:36.203
(chuckles)

00:01:36.203 --> 00:01:37.036
- [Woman] How crazy!

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:38.076
- That's crazy!

00:01:38.076 --> 00:01:39.808
- She's fabulous, you're coming to dinner.

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:41.379
You like cigars?

00:01:41.379 --> 00:01:42.327
- Sure.

00:01:42.327 --> 00:01:43.814
- So you just joined the company?

00:01:43.814 --> 00:01:44.835
- Five years ago.

00:01:44.835 --> 00:01:45.668
- Really?

00:01:45.668 --> 00:01:47.152
- Mango guacamole, very fancy.

00:01:47.152 --> 00:01:48.403
- You like mango.

00:01:48.403 --> 00:01:49.282
- Two bananas.

00:01:49.282 --> 00:01:50.115
- Perfect.

00:01:50.115 --> 00:01:51.032
- Crackers.

00:01:51.975 --> 00:01:53.043
- [Waiter] How is everything?

00:01:53.043 --> 00:01:55.134
- The pasta's a little cold, actually.

00:01:55.134 --> 00:01:56.289
- [Waiter] Ah, let me
heat that up for you.

00:01:56.289 --> 00:01:58.988
- Thank you so much. - Thank you.

00:01:58.988 --> 00:01:59.821
- What?

00:01:59.821 --> 00:02:01.419
- You're so pushy.

00:02:01.419 --> 00:02:02.714
- We're paying for a nice meal,

00:02:02.714 --> 00:02:03.990
I don't think it should be cold.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.240
It's not too much to ask.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.558
- That's what I'm sayin'.

00:02:06.558 --> 00:02:07.892
- I learned from the best.

00:02:07.892 --> 00:02:09.309
- I know you did.

00:02:11.922 --> 00:02:12.914
Aw.

00:02:12.914 --> 00:02:15.164
Sushi, and two cheesecakes.

00:02:16.181 --> 00:02:19.612
- Wow, did you bring anything else?

00:02:19.612 --> 00:02:21.761
- I should've gotten more, I knew it.

00:02:21.761 --> 00:02:23.386
- [Kyle] It was joke.

00:02:23.386 --> 00:02:25.886
Babe, this is feeding an army right here.

00:02:25.886 --> 00:02:26.955
- [Woman] You're just being nice.

00:02:26.955 --> 00:02:29.184
(whooshing and creaking)

